WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
From all fours, tuck the toes and lift the hips up and back.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Straighten the legs as comfortable, forming an inverted V.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Spread the fingers and press the floor away, lengthening the spine.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Relax the neck and draw the heels toward the floor.
